      "config": {
        "title": "Data quality scope",
        "content": "Compare the three retained streams in event time. Telemetry events, overlapping window scores and reported detections count different things. These charts describe retained data, not current service health.\n\n**Navigate:** [Overview](/app/dashboards#/view/logsentinel-overview) | [Detections](/app/dashboards#/view/ransomware-detections) | [Window Scores](/app/dashboards#/view/window-scores) | [Windows Telemetry](/app/dashboards#/view/windows-telemetry) | [Telemetry Quality](/app/dashboards#/view/telemetry-quality)"
