      "config": {
        "title": "Reading coverage and exceptions",
        "content": "Stream charts have independent count scales; retention and replay affect coverage. Exception categories can overlap; zero exceptions in an empty selection proves nothing about runtime health. The time filter can exclude documents missing `@timestamp`; use `verify_dashboards.py --live` for all-time checks and field mappings. Old schema/model versions can coexist; absent ATT&CK and scheduled-window process fields can be valid. These charts do not join window IDs or measure Docker health, Kafka lag, VM connectivity or detection latency."
      }
